, this field is an identifier for the identifier schema, e.g. DOI, ARK.  Get values from https://registry.identifiers.org/registry/ for interoperability. URI-shape values MUST be serialized as JSON-LD IRI references ({\"@id\":\"...\"}) so they participate in RDF entailment; free-label strings remain valid as strings.","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.identifier"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/propertyID"},{"path":["bios:executesLabProtocol","_anyOf","0","schema:object","_anyOf","0","schema:additionalType","_anyOf","1","schema:identifier","schema:value"],"id":"http://schema.org/value","description":"the identifier string. E.g. 10.5066/F7VX0DMQ","schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.identifier"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/value"},{"path":["bios:executesLabProtocol","_anyOf","0","schema:object","_anyOf","0","schema:additionalType","_anyOf","1","schema:identifier","schema:url"],"id":"http://schema.org/url","description":"web-resolveable string for the identifier; host name part is location of a resolver that will return some representation for the given identifier value. E.g. https://doi.org/10.5066/F7VX0DMQ ","schema_type":"string","format":"uri","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.identifier"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/url"},{"path":["bios:executesLabProtocol","_anyOf","0","schema:object","_anyOf","0","schema:additionalType","_anyOf","1","schema:name"],"id":"http://schema.org/name","description":"text label for the term that is useful to human user","schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.schemaorgProperties.definedTerm"],"effectiveId":"http://schema.org/name"},{"path":["bios:executesLabProtocol","schema:result"],"id":"http://schema.org/result","description":"Expected output parameters (FormalParameter references)","schema_type":"array","sources":["bblocks://cdif.bbr.metadata.bioschemasProperties.cdifBioschemasProperties"],"effectiveId